    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks but music doesn't really change anything. it's just more noise in a house that's supposed to be full. it feels kinda stupid to even be this upset over a dog, like, everyone else just moves on and expects you to too. it's like the world just keeps spinning and it doesn't even care that the only thing that actually made sense is gone. it's all just so hollow.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
